1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Map Jinn turns real building footprints into printable map artwork.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:15,500
The demo starts with the built-in account flow, then loads the live GIS workspace.

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:25,500
Search ZIP 30331 and Map Jinn actually moves into that footprint area instead of merely typing the query.

4
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:35,000
Switch footprint styles, add an apparel label and live coordinates, and preview dark or paper mode.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,500
Focus mode gives the map more room on screen.

6
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:52,000
When the design is ready, export a print-ready PNG directly from the rendered map.
